# Cursor Rules: Skills Hub Integration

This workspace integrates with the `skills-hub` MCP server.

- When assisting with specific domain tasks (API design, SQL optimization, Docker, security, testing), query the `skills-hub` MCP tools:
  - `search_skills(query)`
  - `get_skill(skill_name, section="checklist")`
- Do not dump full documentation into chat; extract and apply only actionable items.
